&lt;h1&gt;


  VedaX
&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VedaX turns Vedic Mathematics into a structured learning journey — helping learners learn techniques, practice with purpose, understand their mistakes, and build mastery.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn the technique. Practice with purpose. Master the skill.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  What I Built
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;VedaX is a web application for learners who want to improve mental calculation speed using Vedic Mathematics. It combines:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a 16-technique Vedic Mathematics curriculum;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;technique explanations, examples, and guided practice;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a practice arena and timed challenge modes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;daily challenges and streak tracking;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;progress, XP, level, mastery, mistakes, and recommendations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;prerequisite-aware adaptive learning;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a deterministic mathematical engine that cross-validates every generated question;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a responsive React frontend and an authenticated Express/MongoDB backend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The important design decision is that the browser is not trusted with learning outcomes. The server owns question generation, answer verification, attempts, scoring, XP, mastery, streaks, and reward idempotency.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  The problem
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Many mental-math learning apps are either static content libraries or client-only games. That creates two problems:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learners do not get a clear path from a sutra explanation to measurable mastery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A modified browser can change its own score, XP, streak, or answer state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;VedaX addresses both by pairing educational content with a verified mathematical engine and a server-authoritative learning model.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  The solution in one screen
&lt;/h2&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Choose a technique
       ↓
Learn the sutra and examples
       ↓
Receive a deterministic server-owned question
       ↓
Submit an answer
       ↓
Server verifies it against the stored question
       ↓
Attempt → score → XP → mastery → streak → recommendation
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



