&lt;p&gt;Errors use a stable JSON shape:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight json"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"success"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"message"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"Invalid request"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"error"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"code"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"VALIDATION_ERROR"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"message"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"Invalid request"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"fields"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;"email"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;"Enter a valid email address"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;For full request, response, validation, and error details, see &lt;a href="//docs/api.md"&gt;docs/api.md&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Mathematical engine
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;VedaX currently preserves these 16 stable technique IDs:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ekadhikena-purvena
nikhilam-subtraction
sankalana-vyavakalanabhyam
yavadunam
ekanyunena-purvena
vyastisamastih
vertically-crosswise
anurupyena
puranapuranabhyam
sesanyankena-caramena
sopantyadvayamantyam
paravartya-yojayet
sunyam-samyasamuccaye
chalana-kalanabhyam
gunitasamuccayah
gunakasamuccayah
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Each technique must have:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;catalog metadata;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a deterministic generator;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an independent solver;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;structured explanation steps;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;safe answer normalization and verification;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;normal, invalid, boundary, and randomized tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The engine never uses &lt;code&gt;eval()&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;new Function()&lt;/code&gt;, or arbitrary expression evaluation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Read &lt;a href="//docs/mathematical-engine.md"&gt;docs/mathematical-engine.md&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="//docs/adding-a-technique.md"&gt;docs/adding-a-technique.md&lt;/a&gt; before changing the math engine.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Security
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The backend includes:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;bcrypt password hashing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HS256 JWT verification and token-version revocation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;authenticated ownership queries;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helmet security headers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;exact CORS allowlisting;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;bounded JSON bodies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zod validation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;authentication and API rate limits;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;safe error payloads;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;server-owned questions and answer verification;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;idempotent attempt and reward records;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;conditional session completion claims;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;transactional XP ledger and user updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Do not submit passwords, tokens, keys, or private data in GitHub issues. See &lt;a href="//SECURITY.md"&gt;SECURITY.md&lt;/a&gt; for private vulnerability reporting guidance.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Deployment
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


  Frontend
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The frontend can be deployed from &lt;code&gt;frontend/&lt;/code&gt; to Vercel or Netlify. Configure &lt;code&gt;VITE_API_URL&lt;/code&gt; with the deployed backend API base URL.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


  Backend
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Railway and Render configuration files are included. Configure:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;MONGODB_URI
JWT_SECRET
NODE_ENV=production
PORT
CLIENT_URL
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Use a transaction-capable MongoDB deployment for production rewards. &lt;code&gt;/ready&lt;/code&gt; should be used as the deployment readiness check because it verifies database connectivity.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


  Docker
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The multi-stage Dockerfile builds the frontend and runs the backend:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight shell"&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker build &lt;span class="nt"&gt;-t&lt;/span&gt; vedax &lt;span class="nb"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;
docker run &lt;span class="nt"&gt;--rm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="se"&gt;\&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="nt"&gt;-p&lt;/span&gt; 5000:5000 &lt;span class="se"&gt;\&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="nt"&gt;--env-file&lt;/span&gt; backend/.env &lt;span class="se"&gt;\&lt;/span&gt;
  vedax
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



