&lt;p&gt;The frontend is an approved baseline. Change it only for backend integration, a genuine functional/security bug, production compatibility, or targeted responsive behavior. If frontend files change, the pull request must list each file, the reason, and why the existing UI/UX remains unchanged.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Read:&lt;/p&gt;

