&lt;h2&gt;


  Thank You ❤️
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thank you for reviewing VedaX. The project is intentionally built around a small promise: make mental-math practice more understandable, measurable, and trustworthy without hiding the important rules behind an opaque system.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Overview
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;DoAide Pulse gives indie developers a way to turn project documentation into publishable content without writing a line of copy. The &lt;em&gt;Create from documents&lt;/em&gt; feature is the core of that promise. It lets a developer upload a Markdown or plain‑text file, optionally supply an LLM API key, and then queues a generation job that produces a ready‑to‑publish draft.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Problem
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Writing marketing copy for a side project is a recurring pain point. A developer spends hours turning a README into a blog post, then re‑writes for social. The process is manual, error‑prone, and hard to schedule. On top of that, many developers use a custom LLM or a hosted model; the platform must respect that choice instead of forcing a single provider.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  How It Works
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The feature is built on a stack that mirrors the rest of DoAide Pulse:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;FastAPI endpoint&lt;/strong&gt; – Accepts a file upload and an optional &lt;code&gt;llm_key&lt;/code&gt; field. The request is authenticated via a JWT issued by the dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SQLAlchemy model&lt;/strong&gt; – Stores the draft in a &lt;code&gt;drafts&lt;/code&gt; table with columns for &lt;code&gt;project_id&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;source_path&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;llm_provider&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;llm_key_hash&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;status&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Celery worker&lt;/strong&gt; – Picks up the draft, loads the LLM key from the database, and streams a prompt that instructs the model to convert the source document into a blog‑ready article.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Redis queue&lt;/strong&gt; – Ensures the generation job is processed asynchronously, freeing the API from long‑running calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Post‑processing&lt;/strong&gt; – After generation, the worker runs a quick lint pass to fix Markdown syntax, adds front‑matter tags, and pushes the result to a &lt;em&gt;content calendar&lt;/em&gt; entry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Dev.to API&lt;/strong&gt; – When the user approves the draft, a FastAPI route triggers an authenticated call to the Dev.to endpoint, posting the article with the correct tags and scheduled time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


  Code Snippet: FastAPI Route
&lt;/h3&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight python"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;fastapi&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;APIRouter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;File&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Form&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;UploadFile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Depends&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;sqlalchemy.orm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Session&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;app.db&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;get_db&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;app.models&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Draft&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="n"&gt;router&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;APIRouter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@router.post&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;/drafts/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;status_code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;create_draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="nb"&gt;file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;UploadFile&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;File&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(...),&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;llm_key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;str&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Form&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="bp"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Session&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Depends&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;get_db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;user&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;User&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Depends&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;get_current_user&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;content&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;read&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="n"&gt;project_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;user&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;project_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="n"&gt;source_path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;filename&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="n"&gt;llm_provider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;custom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="n"&gt;llm_key_hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;hash_key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;llm_key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="n"&gt;status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;queued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;commit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;celery_app&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;send_task&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;tasks.generate_draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;args&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;])&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;Draft queued for generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;
 This is where marketing automation pays off in practice.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


  Code Snippet: Celery Task
&lt;/h3&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight python"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;celery&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;shared_task&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;app.db&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;get_db&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;app.models&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Draft&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;app.llm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;generate_from_docs&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@shared_task&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;generate_draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;draft_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;db&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;get_db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;query&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;filter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;draft_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;one&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;llm_key&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;decrypt_key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;llm_key_hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;generate_from_docs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;source_path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;llm_key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;generated_content&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;status&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;ready&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sh"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="n"&gt;db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;commit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;
 Getting marketing automation right early saves rework later.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Using It
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Upload&lt;/strong&gt; – From the dashboard’s &lt;em&gt;Drafts&lt;/em&gt; tab, click &lt;em&gt;Create from documents&lt;/em&gt;, choose a file, and optionally paste your LLM API key.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Queue&lt;/strong&gt; – The UI shows a spinner and a status badge that updates from &lt;em&gt;queued&lt;/em&gt; → &lt;em&gt;processing&lt;/em&gt; → &lt;em&gt;ready&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Review&lt;/strong&gt; – Once ready, the draft appears in the &lt;em&gt;Content Calendar&lt;/em&gt; with a preview. You can edit the Markdown, adjust tags, or change the scheduled publish time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Approve&lt;/strong&gt; – Hit &lt;em&gt;Publish&lt;/em&gt;; the system calls the Dev.to API, logs the article URL, and updates the dashboard with the live link.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The entire flow takes a few seconds for the API call, a few minutes for generation (depending on the LLM), and then instant posting. No manual copy‑paste or external tooling is required. Good marketing automation keeps the rest of the workflow predictable.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Technical Details
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;FastAPI&lt;/strong&gt; handles HTTP and WebSocket endpoints, providing low‑latency routing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SQLAlchemy&lt;/strong&gt; maps the &lt;code&gt;drafts&lt;/code&gt; table to a Python class, enabling migrations via Alembic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Celery + Redis&lt;/strong&gt; decouple the long‑running generation from the request‑response cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;React + Vite + Tailwind CSS&lt;/strong&gt; render the dashboard; the &lt;em&gt;Drafts&lt;/em&gt; component fetches status via a polling hook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt; stores draft metadata and content; migrations include a &lt;code&gt;CHECK&lt;/code&gt; constraint to ensure &lt;code&gt;status&lt;/code&gt; values are valid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Dev.to API&lt;/strong&gt; integration uses the &lt;code&gt;devto&lt;/code&gt; Python package (or raw &lt;code&gt;requests&lt;/code&gt;) with OAuth scopes for publishing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The commit log shows recent fixes that directly benefit this feature: automatic SEO preflight fixes, dashboard bug patches, and analytics pipeline health checks. These improvements mean that every generated draft is already SEO‑ready and that the UI remains stable even under load. Treat marketing automation as a habit rather than a one-off task.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Conclusion
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;By turning raw documentation into polished blog posts, the &lt;em&gt;Create from documents&lt;/em&gt; feature removes the friction that typically deters indie developers from marketing their work. It leverages the same core stack that powers DoAide Pulse’s scheduling, publishing, and analytics, ensuring a consistent developer experience across the platform.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Related reading
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/sumaninster/ai-content-generation-for-developer-marketing-38mp"&gt;AI Content Generation for Developer Marketing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/sumaninster/marketing-automation-ai-generated-seo-fields-in-doaide-pulse-11gf"&gt;Marketing Automation: AI‑Generated SEO Fields in DoAide Pulse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Frontend work often stops at the browser's edge. The app runs against a mock API, and the real backend appears late, with its own URLs and CORS settings. TDK CLI Core keeps the frontend inside the same local stack as its backends, so it talks to the real services from the start.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Starting a frontend
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Create a frontend resource with &lt;code&gt;tdk resource &amp;lt;name&amp;gt; --type frontend&lt;/code&gt;. The default framework is React, and the CLI also supports Vue, Svelte, Preact, Lit, Solid, Qwik, Vanilla, and TanStack Router. Pick the framework with &lt;code&gt;--framework&lt;/code&gt;, and list the options with &lt;code&gt;--frameworks&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The resource is written under &lt;code&gt;services/&amp;lt;stack&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;/&lt;/code&gt;. Install dependencies, then start the stack with &lt;code&gt;tdk up&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  What you get
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Each frontend is a Vite app built into a container that serves through nginx. TDK also generates three helper files that remove the usual setup work:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;api-client.ts&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is a client preconfigured for the frontend's API route, so you do not hand-write URLs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;env.ts&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; exports the API URL the generated stack uses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;api-index.ts&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; re-exports the client and URL, so imports stay short.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These files live in &lt;code&gt;.autogenerated/&lt;/code&gt;. Import from them, and do not edit them. If the API changes, change the backend and let TDK regenerate.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Working day to day
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Edit the source files in your &lt;code&gt;src/&lt;/code&gt; folder. The stack is built with Tilt, so changes reach the running container without a full rebuild. Check the stack's state with &lt;code&gt;tdk status --json&lt;/code&gt; or the dashboard from &lt;code&gt;tdk ui&lt;/code&gt;, which lets you move through services and search their output.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  What stays your job
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;TDK generates the plumbing. It does not design the interface, handle loading and error states, or decide how the app behaves when the API is slow. Those belong to you, and they are where most of the frontend work is.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  A practical first session
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a frontend with &lt;code&gt;tdk resource shop-web --type frontend -y&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run &lt;code&gt;tdk up main --dry-run&lt;/code&gt; and check the plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start the stack with &lt;code&gt;tdk up&lt;/code&gt;, and open the frontend's URL from the output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Import the generated API client in one component, and call one endpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the loading and error states explicit before you add anything else.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Summary
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A frontend in TDK CLI Core runs in the same stack as its backends, with a generated API client and environment config. You write the interface and its states. TDK keeps the wiring consistent with the services behind it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;


  Benchmarking Paperclip Agent Orchestration: Concurrent Task Throughput and Memory Overhead Under Load
&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When evaluating &lt;a href="https://github.com/paperclipai/paperclip" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;paperclipai/paperclip&lt;/a&gt; for production agent orchestration, I needed concrete performance data under realistic multi-user concurrency. Here's what I measured and where the architecture holds up.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Test Topology
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Next.js 15.2 app router with React Server Components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-core, 8GB VPS (DigitalOcean)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PostgreSQL 16 with connection pooling (pgBouncer, 20 max connections)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;k6 load generator simulating 50 concurrent users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scenario:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Each virtual user triggers a multi-step agent workflow:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create new task via Server Action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agent processes task (calls LLM via B-Lost relay gateway at &lt;code&gt;https://b-lost.com/v1&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stream incremental results back to UI via Suspense boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update task status in database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code Configuration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight typescript"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// app/actions/agent-task.ts&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;use server&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;z&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;zod&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;auth&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;@/lib/auth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;TaskSchema&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="na"&gt;prompt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;().&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;min&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;max&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;2000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="na"&gt;agentId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;().&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;uuid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;createAgentTask&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;infer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;typeof&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;TaskSchema&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;session&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;auth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;session&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;throw&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Error&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Unauthorized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

  &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;validated&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;TaskSchema&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;parse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

  &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Paperclip agent dispatch&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;response&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;fetch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;https://b-lost.com/v1/chat/completions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="na"&gt;method&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;POST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="na"&gt;headers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Authorization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;`Bearer &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;${&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;env&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;BLOST_API_KEY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;`&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;Content-Type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;application/json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="na"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;JSON&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;stringify&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="na"&gt;model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;claude-sonnet-4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="na"&gt;messages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;user&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;content&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;validated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;prompt&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}],&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="na"&gt;stream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="p"&gt;}),&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt;

  &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;response&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Stream to client&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;





&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight javascript"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// k6-load-test.js&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;http&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;k6/http&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;
